{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/extras/gif_krallik.gif?t=1749891074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your first taste of rebellion in the <i><strong>Bite the Crown</strong></i> demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a glimpse into the uprising as you take control of a sentient mold fighting to dismantle the Snack King\u2019s regime from within. Experience the opening moments of the campaign and get hands-on with the systems that power your resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in the Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/extras/gif_dovus.gif?t=1749891074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f <strong>The First Dungeon</strong> \u2013 Infiltrate a sealed-off snack dungeon crawling with the King\u2019s enforcers. Learn the basics of stealth, sabotage, and snack-to-snack combat as you uncover the first cracks in the Kingdom\u2019s foundations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/extras/gif_sehir.gif?t=1749891074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Guild Building</strong> \u2013 Begin shaping your rebellion by exploring the guild system. Recruit discarded snacks, assign them to operations, and start upgrading your underground hideout with limited early-game tools and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Capital City Preview</strong> \u2013 Get a first look at the Snack Kingdom\u2019s capital: a bustling, dystopian metropolis. While fully locked down in the demo, you\u2019ll be able to explore a small, controlled district that hints at the scale and depth of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're here for strategic base-building, story-rich infiltration, or food-fueled rebellion, this demo offers a flavorful slice of what's to come.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765240?t=1749891074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765240?t=1749891074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/fdffc38986bfe31172e62473829d9a58237edd6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749891074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/fdffc38986bfe31172e62473829d9a58237edd6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749891074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/extras/gif_krallik.gif?t=1749891074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your first taste of rebellion in the <i><strong>Bite the Crown</strong></i> demo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a glimpse into the uprising as you take control of a sentient mold fighting to dismantle the Snack King\u2019s regime from within. Experience the opening moments of the campaign and get hands-on with the systems that power your resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Included in the Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/extras/gif_dovus.gif?t=1749891074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f <strong>The First Dungeon</strong> \u2013 Infiltrate a sealed-off snack dungeon crawling with the King\u2019s enforcers. Learn the basics of stealth, sabotage, and snack-to-snack combat as you uncover the first cracks in the Kingdom\u2019s foundations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/extras/gif_sehir.gif?t=1749891074\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Guild Building</strong> \u2013 Begin shaping your rebellion by exploring the guild system. Recruit discarded snacks, assign them to operations, and start upgrading your underground hideout with limited early-game tools and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f <strong>Capital City Preview</strong> \u2013 Get a first look at the Snack Kingdom\u2019s capital: a bustling, dystopian metropolis. While fully locked down in the demo, you\u2019ll be able to explore a small, controlled district that hints at the scale and depth of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're here for strategic base-building, story-rich infiltration, or food-fueled rebellion, this demo offers a flavorful slice of what's to come.</p>","developers":["Nyra Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3564750","name":"Bite the Crown"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765240/f986553b9c99bbbaad470e6f86488507738e95b7/header.jpg?t=1749891074","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS 11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i7-9750H or more<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 5300M 